1-18T02:19:36.821Z","images":{"preview":"/watches/gtQS4Veo6G/preview?updatedAt=1646898308975","previewSmall":"/watches/gtQS4Veo6G/preview-small?updatedAt=1646898308975"},"__v":5,"watchSell":{"currentAmount":300,"detailWallpaperImageUrl":null,"descImages":[],"originalAmount":650,"atDiscount":true,"isHidden":false,"isCollaboration":false,"onlyEvent":false,"exclusiveCountries":[],"isLimited":false,"sellTypes":["NORMAL"],"_id":"619747d6483f107ddba62126","watchSellId":"b1HS2TnlMf","title":"Signal Neo","watchPosition":4,"updatedAt":"2025-05-28T01:26:10.191Z","createdAt":"2021-11-21T15:00:01.010Z","titleI18n":{"ko":"","en":"","ja":""},"purchased":false,"wallpaperImageUrl":null,"smallListWallpaperImageUrl":null,"listWallpaperImageUrl":null,"premiumSubscribeAmount":300,"liteSubscribeAmount":300,"todayAvailableForSubscription":false},"descriptionI18n":{"en":"#TIMEFLIK Subscriber Exclusive Watch Face\n\nThis watch face is provided exclusively for subscribers.\nYou can check the watch face applying history on My Page > Recently Sent.\nWhen your subscription expires, you can no longer access a watch face.\n\n#Features\n\n[Time & Date]\n - Digital Time\n - 12/24 Hour Format\n - Date\n\n[Device]\n - Watch Battery\n\n[Etc.]\n - Alway on Display\n\n#Notice\n\n - Weather and health information can be set in the TIMEFLIK mobile & watch app.\n - Be sure to allow access to the location and sensor in the watch app to display the weather and health information.","ko":"#타임플릭 구독 전용 워치페이스\n\n구독 전용 워치페이스는 정기 구독자만 사용할 수 있는 전용 상품이에요.\n보내기 한 워치페이스는 마이페이지 최근 적용 목록에서 확인하실 수 있어요.\n구독이 만료되면 워치페이스를 더 이상 적용할 수 없음에 유의해 주세요.\n\n#주요 기능\n\n[시간 & 날짜]\n - 디지털 시계\n - 12/24시간 포맷 지원\n - 날짜\n\n[디바이스 정보]\n - 배터리 잔량\n\n[기타]\n - Alway on Display\n\n#주의사항\n\n - 날씨 및 헬스 정보는 타임플릭 모바일 앱과 워치 앱에서 설정할 수 있어요.\n - 날씨 및 헬스 정보가 표시되지 않으면 워치 앱에서 위치 정보와 센서의 접근 권한이 허용되어 있는지 확인해 주세요.","ja":"#タイムフリックサブスク専用文字盤\n\nサブスク専用文字盤はサブスク決済後に使用できる専用商品です。ダウンロードした文字盤はマイページの最近適用でご確認できます。サブスクが期限切れになると文字盤の使用はできなくなりますので、注意してください。a\n\n#ご案内\n\n - 天気およびヘルス情報はタイムフリックアプリとウォッチアプリで設定できます。\n - 天気やヘルス情報が表示されない場合は、ウォッチアプリで位置情報と\nセンサーのアクセス権限が許可されていることを確認してください。"},"seriesId":null,"descriptionImages":null,"descriptionLink":null,"descriptionTitle":null,"descriptionLinkTitle":null,"hasHealthData":false,"favorite":270,"comments":3,"commentList":[{"content":"일반구매로 가능하게 해주세요 ","_id":"63ffa210b69bfa7b841b2527","watchCommentId":"hwjzEG0nwb","user":{"nickname":"바야바","_id":"6251ed62694aff53ff84525c","userId":"1TfburrXxq","updatedAt":"2022-05-20T01:43:27.431Z","thumbnail":"/api/users/1TfburrXxq/thumbnail?updatedAt=1653011007431"},"createdAt":"2023-03-01T19:05:52.803Z"},{"content":"이거 구매로 풀어주면 안됩니까?","_id":"62ee32a2957bb3372efc4e48","watchCommentId":"e6a9M5XYKu","user":{"nickname":"rainbow631","_id":"62c1b8da519bb277fa01d2d2","userId":"uJir1fhdPU","updatedAt":"2025-04-25T01:42:10.329Z","thumbnail":"/api/users/uJir1fhdPU/thumbnail?updatedAt=1745545330329"},"createdAt":"2022-08-06T09:21:38.078Z"},{"content":"time  set kro ","_id":"61accd17ca099252709c451d","watchCommentId":"LAsfRDx1kq","user":{"nickname":"R P Jain","_id":"61accc45c28c93290b43c285","userId":"932coL1PTh","thumbnail":"/api/users/932coL1PTh/thumbnail?updatedAt="},"createdAt":"2021-12-05T14:30:47.017Z"}],"inFavorites":false}